  "description": "\n<p>The headers returned from RDF Sources, and particularly Containers, have a few minor issues:</p>\n\n<ul class=\"alternate\" type=\"square\">\n\t<li>[ ] Content-Length is 0 on a HEAD, and should be the number of bytes of the representation if you had done a GET instead.</li>\n\t<li>[ ] application/ld+json is missing from Accept-Post for containers</li>\n\t<li>[ ] The Vary header is missing, even though the resources will content negotiate on at least Accept and Prefer</li>\n</ul>\n",
